---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-existing Reservedge/ITAA platform
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Created before or independently of the AWS Agents for Humans competition window:

- Cloud-neutral domain, application, policy, ranking, and contracts packages
- A1–A4 human authorization (requirement confirmation, disclosure authorization,
  offer selection, simulated transaction authorization)
- Disclosure and isolation (minimum disclosure; isolated supplier envelopes)
- Deterministic ranking
- Simulated suppliers (ParkDirect, SkyShield, TerminalFlex)
- FastAPI golden path
- React/Vite buyer UI
- Intent-first substrate (composer, Clarify & Plan, Explicit / Inferred /
  Proposed labels)

The Google/Gemini adapter under adapters/google is pre-existing adapter work
and is not claimed as part of this AWS Devpost submission.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Competition-period AWS work
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Developed for AWS Agents for Humans (Everyday Agents track) during the
competition period:

- Strands Agents SDK integration (adapters/aws-strands-bedrock-agentcore)
- Amazon Bedrock live Plan path (fail-closed unless explicitly invoked)
- Provider HTTP /v1/aws/**
- Product BFF /v1/agent/** and conversation-first agent session / domain state
- Multi-domain capability routing (stay, flight, experience, parking, rental)
- Conversational search authorization and requirement refinements
- LiteAPI stay and flight research adapter (adapters/liteapi-hotels) — sandbox search only
- Booking Chats inbox (Running / Pending / History)
- Prioticket experience adapter (adapters/prioticket-experiences); city catalog
  inventory is currently provider-limited
- Browser wiring of Start booking through /v1/agent/**
- AWS competition evaluation, demo, and submission material under
  docs/demo-aws and docs/submissions-aws
